<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Baxter started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Baxter started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it started coverage of the post-split shares in Baxter International Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Started Allegiance Corp, spun-off from Baxter in September, with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Baxter shares fell 3/8 to 42-7/8. Allegiance shares rose 3/8 to 22-1/4 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
